# Retrieval eval set: query -> title(s) of known-relevant passages (real corpus
# titles). A retrieved passage is a hit when its title matches a relevant title
# (case-insensitive substring, either direction). Mix of easy (title in query)
# and harder (symptom-/paraphrase-based) cases so tuning has signal.
